<description>&lt;p&gt;Drone attacks on a Colombian military base in the north killed three soldiers and wounded eight, showing an escalation of direct violence. Armed men entered a house in Toro, Colombia and murdered three women, adding to civilian casualties. The conflict remains a low-intensity asymmetric war involving the government, paramilitary groups, crime syndicates and far-left guerrillas. The UCDP recorded 225 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxPVkQyTU5QLS1RV0N3SU1iekhjb2pIbmpEOGJOZUZYaFA2di1zVXdQa0RHNjRmODhJYWRPSVFfWlZXNmFvM2F1YVdydHNzaWZQRHVjOUJDTkt2VHhSQXgwNkdYdlZQVXlpWTJCNVRyZG1hLWdEdG9zdllaLS0zX0Z1UHhnaTF4TzY2Tkt3N1NlNkZvTjQyYk9zZl9OY1VWVmc1bFY4?oc=5&quot;&gt;Mail &amp;amp; Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxNMzh3d0l5SUNjRUM2UThsUjZramdqYUxYZV9OaDhDbmdlNnBHTzNmZy1MaDNubjRBeXJsajVqWl9EWDFfOEVhWnE4TXQtZ2RWZFA1VFEtSVF0ZlJwcFVuZV9wVE5DamdxVFhhTUlpUlZxQWpkSDVEZUp3ZWJ1ZHJpSlVabGtBSHVlR1hhODhB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Latest news from Azerbaijan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWEFVX3lxTE9UYkkxZEIweVZZWnd0NG1JYmdaM2o2SUMwUFh1SkIxa3BLVGZCdkFORW9kZ0E4eHFycDFOT0tZcGZVLTlqYVhFQm5PVmF1R0JUdzlKbFdSczk?oc=5&quot;&gt;TRT World&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxOaFhHbWFCVkVWREZnZnF2MEJnZUtsNGJCYmNJWmczYXMwOHo0WlFmVFVrVVp2UExVY2x0ZFUtb0NSWlB0eEtRNFRFdjQ5YTU2ZC1JR0lYX1Nyci1HNVJFRzZiQVJtSFNpdHhBVm9Jckp0R3VuTHo4d0Zyc2FPMUlMdF9WMlU?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haberler.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxPVEl0MDhUOG83bjRHQ24yemxjWHFaTFJQSVhlZ3Z5RE1ORmdNZXVrNVFGNFY3eU9iTFc0a3M0Si1la0xUTm9ONEFxZU1LWHplaFFJdHJ2V1dwTGRJSTdxTnB